      "content": "wait, you can just give me a prescription for ciprofloxacin? i didn't realize you could do that. that would save me so much time. but i'm still a bit worried about it being a deep hole... if I take the pills, should I also try to seal the wound shut with something like superglue so nothing gets in while i'm walking around? i want to make sure no more dirt gets trapped in there.",
