      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, i'll stick to the ointment for now. but i'm still really stressed about the tetanus risk since the tool was so rusty. since i'm trying to avoid the clinic, is there any way i can counteract the risk using something at home? like, can i take some really high doses of vitamins or maybe even some other antibiotics to make sure the infection doesn't set in? is there a specific amount i should take to be safe until i can get a shot next week?",
